            "sid": "ISA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumafuku adiŋiyi mwanta wawaYuda Ahazi mwana kaYotami, Yotami mwana kaUziya, mwanta wakuSiriya Rezini, nimwanta wawaIsarela Peka mwana kaRemaliya hiyakuya kuYerusalema nakwasa nawunjita, hiyakuyikaŋa anya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuleja mutaŋi waDavidi, nawu, Siriya wakwata delii wubwambu naEfweremi. Nimuchima windi, ninyi chima yawantu indi, hiyikwenda mwivumu neyi chiyendapa nyitondu yamwisaŋa nampepela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwila Isaya, nindi, Yenu dinu namwaneyi Sheyari Yashubi mwakamubulakani Ahazi kunsa yakapila kakwijiya dakundundamu, mumukwakwa wakwiha damukwakukosa mahina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakamwilineyi, Chiwukumona yeniyi yikunku yayimunyi yidi nakufwinda wishi, nikuzuwa kwaRezini naSiriya namwana kaRemaliya kwasweja, babalaku, wudupumiki zo-o, bayi wutiya womaku, bayi wuzeya mumuchima weyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulona Siriya nakukwatili dehi mpùŋa yatama, niEfweremi nimwana kaRemaliya nawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Tuyenu kuYuda twakayibabeshi, twakabaluli mpwembu yawu, twakaswanishumu mwanta, yowu mwana kaTabeyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
